msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Survival"
msgstr "生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Perform analyses of censored time to event data."
msgstr "对删失的生存时间数据进行分析。"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Classical"
msgstr "经典"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Non-Parametric"
msgstr "非参数"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Non-Parametric Survival Analysis"
msgstr "非参数生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Semi-Parametric"
msgstr "半参数"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Semi-Parametric Survival Analysis"
msgstr "半参数生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Parametric"
msgstr "参数化（Parametric）"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Parametric Survival Analysis"
msgstr "参数生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Parametric Mixture"
msgstr "参数混合模型"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Parametric Mixture Survival Analysis"
msgstr "参数混合生存分析"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis computes a survival curve for censored data using the Kaplan-"
"Meier estimator for single-event survival data. It estimates the probability "
"of survival over time, allowing you to understand and visualize the "
"distribution of survival times within your data. The analysis accommodates "
"censored observations (subjects for whom the event has not occurred during "
"the study period) and enables comparison of survival curves across different "
"groups using statistical tests such as the Log-Rank test, Peto and Peto "
"test, and Fleming-Harrington test. Additionally, you can generate life "
"tables to summarize survival data at specified intervals."
msgstr ""
"本分析使用 Kaplan-Meier 估计为单事件生存数据中的删失数据计算生存曲线。它估计"
"随时间推移的生存概率，帮助您理解和可视化数据中生存时间的分布。该分析可处理删"
"失观测（在研究期间未发生事件的受试者），并可使用 Log-Rank 检验、Peto 与 Peto "
"检验以及 Fleming-Harrington 检验等统计检验比较不同组别的生存曲线。此外，您还"
"可以生成生命表，以指定间隔汇总生存数据。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "生存时间"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs."
msgstr "选择表示事件发生或删失前时间的变量。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "事件状态"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr "选择表示事件状态的变量，指明每个观测是事件还是删失。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "事件指示值"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr "指定事件状态变量中表示事件发生的值。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata"
msgstr "分层"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to define strata, allowing separate survival curves for "
"each stratum."
msgstr "选择用于定义分层的变量，以便为每个层分别生成生存曲线。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "权重"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr "选择个案权重变量，在模型中对每个观测按相应权重加权。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "删失汇总"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr "创建汇总表，包含数据删失状态的信息。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "检验"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-rank (Mantel-Haenszel)"
msgstr "Log-Rank（Mantel-Haenszel）"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Log-Rank (Mantel-Haenszel) test to compare survival curves "
"across strata."
msgstr "纳入 Log-Rank（Mantel-Haenszel）检验，以比较各层的生存曲线。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Peto and Peto"
msgstr "Peto 与 Peto"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Peto and Peto modification of the Gehan-Wilcoxon test to compare "
"survival curves across strata."
msgstr "纳入 Gehan-Wilcoxon 检验的 Peto 与 Peto 修正，以比较各层的生存曲线。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Flemming-Harrington"
msgstr "Fleming-Harrington"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Fleming-Harrington test to compare survival curves across "
"strata., with a customizable rho parameter."
msgstr ""
"纳入 Fleming-Harrington 检验，以比较各层的生存曲线，并可自定义 rho 参数。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rho"
msgstr "rho"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the rho parameter for the Fleming-Harrington test, controlling the "
"weight given to different time points (values between 0 and 1)."
msgstr ""
"设置 Fleming-Harrington 检验的 rho 参数，控制不同时间点的权重（取值 0 到 "
"1）。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Life table"
msgstr "生命表"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Generate a life table summarizing survival data at specified time intervals."
msgstr "生成生命表，以指定时间间隔汇总生存数据。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps type"
msgstr "步长类型"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the method to define intervals for the life table: Default, "
"Quantiles, or Fixed size. Quantiles uses empirical quantiles of the observed "
"times, including censored times, after frequency weights are applied; these "
"are not quantiles of the estimated survival distribution."
msgstr ""
"选择定义生命表区间的方法：默认、分位数或固定大小。分位数使用应用频数权重后观"
"测时间（包括删失时间）的经验分位数；这些不是估计生存分布的分位数。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Quantiles"
msgstr "分位数"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed size"
msgstr "固定大小"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Number"
msgstr "编号"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify the number of intervals when using Quantiles as the steps type."
msgstr "使用分位数步长类型时，指定区间数。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Round steps"
msgstr "舍入步长"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Round the interval boundaries to the nearest integer when using Quantiles "
"steps."
msgstr "使用分位数步长时，将区间边界舍入到最接近的整数。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "From"
msgstr "起始"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the starting time for intervals when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "使用固定大小步长时，设置区间起始时间。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Define the size of each interval when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "使用固定大小步长时，定义每个区间的大小。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "To"
msgstr "结束"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the ending time for intervals when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "使用固定大小步长时，设置区间结束时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the mixture model. "
"The covariates affect the location parameter of each component with separate "
"coefficients."
msgstr ""
"添加连续变量作为协变量，将其纳入混合模型。协变量通过各自系数影响每个成分的位"
"置参数。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the mixture model. "
"The factors affect the location parameter of each component with separate "
"coefficients."
msgstr ""
"添加分类变量作为因子，将其纳入混合模型。因子通过各自系数影响每个成分的位置参"
"数。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select right-censored data, counting-process data with entry and exit times, "
"or interval-censored data (including left-censored observations)."
msgstr ""
"选择右删失数据、带有进入和退出时间的计数过程数据，或区间删失数据（包括左删失"
"观测）。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parametric distribution of the mixture components (all components "
"come from the same distribution). All fits and display results for all "
"'Selected parametric families' in the 'Advanced' section. 'Best AIC' and "
"'Best BIC' fit all `Selected parametric families` in the Advanced section "
"and display the results only for a parametric family with the lowest AIC/"
"BIC. Families without a closed-form weighted fit (gamma, Gompertz, and the "
"generalized families) are considerably slower to estimate."
msgstr ""
"选择混合成分的参数分布（所有成分来自同一分布）。所有拟合和显示结果针对“高级”"
"部分中的所有“所选参数族”。“最佳 AIC”和“最佳 BIC”会拟合“高级”部分中的所有“所选"
"参数族”，并仅显示 AIC/BIC 最低的参数族结果。没有闭式加权拟合的族（Gamma、"
"Gompertz 及广义族）估计速度会明显更慢。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best AIC"
msgstr "最佳 AIC"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best BIC"
msgstr "最佳 BIC"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Components"
msgstr "成分"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the number of mixture components. 'All' fits and displays results for "
"one up to the maximum number of components set in the 'Advanced' section. "
"'Best AIC' and 'Best BIC' fit the same models and display the results only "
"for the number of components with the lowest AIC/BIC. A fixed number of "
"components is not limited by the maximum number of components."
msgstr ""
"选择混合成分数。“全部”会拟合并显示从 1 到“高级”部分设置的最大成分数的结果。"
"“最佳 AIC”和“最佳 BIC”拟合相同模型，并仅显示 AIC/BIC 最低的成分数结果。固定成"
"分数不受最大成分数限制。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the model to interpret. Defaults to the last specified model. "
"Alternatives are 'All' which produces results for all of the specified "
"models or 'Best' which produces results for the best fitting model based on "
"either AIC or BIC. The selection proceeds within each subgroup from the "
"distribution to the number of components to the model: 'Best' keeps the "
"level of the best fitting model across all remaining distributions, numbers "
"of components, and models, and 'All' selects separately within each of its "
"levels (e.g., all distributions with the best number of components and the "
"best model within each distribution)."
msgstr ""
"选择要解释的模型。默认为最后指定的模型。其他选项包括“全部”（为所有指定模型生"
"成结果）或“最佳”（根据 AIC 或 BIC 为最佳拟合模型生成结果）。选择在每个子组内"
"按分布→成分数→模型的顺序进行：“最佳”在所有剩余分布、成分数和模型中保留最佳拟"
"合模型的水平；“全部”则在其每个水平内分别选择（例如，具有最佳成分数的所有分"
"布，以及每个分布内的最佳模型）。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with information about the model fit. The BIC uses the "
"number of observations (including censored observations and weighted by the "
"case weights) as the sample size."
msgstr ""
"纳入包含模型拟合信息的表格。BIC 以观测数（包括删失观测，并按个案权重加权）作"
"为样本量。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mixture"
msgstr "混合"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean and median"
msgstr "均值和中位数"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the mean and the median lifetime of each mixture "
"component. They correspond to the reference level of factors and zero value "
"of covariates. The mixing probabilities and the parameters of the components "
"are reported in the coefficients summary. Components are ordered by their "
"median lifetime."
msgstr ""
"纳入包含每个混合成分的平均寿命和中位寿命的表格。它们对应因子的参考水平和协变"
"量的零值。混合概率和成分参数在系数汇总中报告。成分按其中位寿命排序。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Classification"
msgstr "分类"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the number and proportion of observations assigned to "
"each component based on their highest posterior probability, the mean "
"posterior probability of the assigned observations, and the relative entropy "
"of the classification."
msgstr ""
"纳入表格，列出根据最高后验概率分配到每个成分的观测数量和比例、被分配观测的平"
"均后验概率，以及分类的相对熵。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the quantiles at which survival times are predicted: evenly spaced "
"Quantiles, a Sequence, or Custom probabilities."
msgstr "选择预测生存时间所依据的分位数：等距分位数、序列或自定义概率。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of quantiles of the predicted survival when using "
"Quantiles as the steps type."
msgstr "使用分位数步长类型时，指定预测生存的分位数数量。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the time points for prediction tables: Equal spacing, a Sequence, or "
"Custom times. Time plots place unrounded points adaptively within the "
"selected range."
msgstr ""
"选择预测表的时间点：等距、序列或自定义时间。时间图会在所选范围内自适应放置未"
"舍入的点。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define the time increment when using Sequence steps. Leaving this blank uses "
"one tenth of the selected time range."
msgstr "使用序列步长时，定义时间增量。留空则使用所选时间范围的十分之一。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify custom time points for predictions."
msgstr "指定用于预测的自定义时间点。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival time across the numbers of components into a "
"single plot. Only available when all numbers of components are displayed and "
"no model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""
"将不同成分数下的生存时间图合并为一张图。仅当显示所有成分数且未执行模型选择时"
"可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival probabilities, hazard, cumulative hazard, and "
"restricted mean survival across the numbers of components into a single "
"plot. Only available when all numbers of components are displayed and no "
"model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""
"将不同成分数下的生存概率、风险率、累积风险和限制平均生存图合并为一张图。仅当"
"显示所有成分数且未执行模型选择时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted time"
msgstr "残差与预测时间"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimation diagnostics"
msgstr "估计诊断"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Component plot"
msgstr "成分图"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the displayed function: the survival probability of the mixture and "
"of each component, the failure probability of the mixture and of each "
"component, the density of the mixture and the weighted density of each "
"component (which sum to the mixture density), or the hazard of the mixture "
"and of each component."
msgstr ""
"选择显示的函数：混合模型及各成分的生存概率，混合模型及各成分的失败概率，混合"
"模型的密度及各成分的加权密度（两者之和为混合密度），或混合模型及各成分的风险"
"率。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Survival probability"
msgstr "生存概率"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Failure probability"
msgstr "失败概率"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Density"
msgstr "密度"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard"
msgstr "风险率"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Observed data"
msgstr "观测数据"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the probability plots across the numbers of components into a single "
"plot. Only available when all numbers of components are displayed and no "
"model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""
"将不同成分数下的概率图合并为一张图。仅当显示所有成分数且未执行模型选择时可"
"用。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级选项"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Constrain minimum spread"
msgstr "约束最小离散度"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Fit by constrained maximum likelihood with a minimum standard deviation of "
"the natural logarithm of survival time in every component, including one-"
"component models. Available for log-normal, Weibull, log-logistic, and gamma "
"distributions; other distributions are deselected. Checkbox choices made in "
"Selected Parametric Distributions before turning the constraint on are "
"restored when it is turned off again, provided the analysis form has not "
"been reloaded. When the bound is active, point estimates remain available "
"but standard errors, confidence intervals, covariance estimates, and regular "
"inferential tests are not reported."
msgstr ""
"使用约束最大似然拟合，要求每个成分（包括单成分模型）中生存时间自然对数的最小"
"标准差。适用于对数正态、Weibull、对数 Logistic 和 Gamma 分布；其他分布将被取"
"消选择。关闭约束后，如果在开启约束前在“所选参数分布”中做出的复选框选择未被重"
"新加载分析表单，则会恢复。当该界限生效时，点估计仍可用，但不报告标准误、置信"
"区间、协方差估计和常规推断检验。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Relative"
msgstr "相对"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Absolute"
msgstr "绝对"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the minimum log-time standard deviation relative to an unconstrained one-"
"component fit of the same distribution, or as an absolute value. The "
"reference fit uses the same data, predictors, censoring, and weights and is "
"computed separately for each model and subgroup."
msgstr ""
"设置最小对数时间标准差，可相对于同一分布的无约束单成分拟合，或设为绝对值。参"
"考拟合使用相同数据、预测变量、删失和权重，并对每个模型和子组分别计算。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Minimum log-time SD"
msgstr "最小对数时间标准差"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set a positive percentage of the unconstrained one-component model's log-"
"time standard deviation as the minimum for every component. The default is "
"1%. For models with predictors, the reference is the conditional "
"distribution's log-time standard deviation. For delayed entry, it refers to "
"the distribution before conditioning on entry."
msgstr ""
"将无约束单成分模型对数时间标准差的某个正百分比设为每个成分的最小值。默认值为 "
"1%。对于含预测变量的模型，参考值为条件分布的对数时间标准差。对于延迟进入，指"
"进入条件化之前的分布。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set a positive lower bound, up to 100, on the standard deviation of the "
"natural logarithm of survival time. Choose a minimum justified by the "
"application and check sensitivity to other values; 0.1 is an editable "
"preset, not a universal recommendation. The bound is unchanged when the "
"units of survival time change. For delayed entry, it bounds the component "
"distribution before conditioning on entry."
msgstr ""
"设置生存时间自然对数标准差的正下界（最大 100）。请选择有应用依据的最小值，并"
"检查对其他值的敏感性；0.1 是可编辑的预设值，不是通用建议。生存时间单位改变时"
"该界限不变。对于延迟进入，它约束进入条件化之前的成分分布。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum components"
msgstr "最大成分数"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of components fitted when 'All', 'Best AIC', or 'Best "
"BIC' is selected as the number of components."
msgstr "当成分数选择“全部”、“最佳 AIC”或“最佳 BIC”时，设置拟合的最大成分数。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Starting Values"
msgstr "起始值"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "K-means"
msgstr "k 均值"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from a k-means clustering of the log survival times. The likelihood is "
"maximized directly from this starting value."
msgstr "从对数生存时间的 k 均值聚类开始。似然直接从该起始值最大化。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Random"
msgstr "随机"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the number of random starting values."
msgstr "设置随机起始值的数量。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "EM iterations"
msgstr "EM 迭代次数"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the number of EM iterations that refine each starting value before the "
"likelihood is maximized directly. The state after the first and after the "
"last EM iteration are both used as starting values of the direct "
"maximization."
msgstr ""
"设置每个起始值在直接最大化似然之前经过的 EM 迭代次数。第一次和最后一次 EM 迭"
"代后的状态都用作直接最大化的起始值。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare models across components"
msgstr "跨成分数比较模型"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Compare models across the numbers of components. This option is only "
"available when multiple models and numbers of components are specified."
msgstr "跨成分数比较模型。仅当指定了多个模型和成分数时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Always display model information (distribution, number of components, and "
"model name) in output tables."
msgstr "在输出表格中始终显示模型信息（分布、成分数和模型名称）。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "This analysis performs a parametric survival analysis."
msgstr "本分析执行参数生存分析。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr "区间起点"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr "选择表示观测区间起始时间的变量。仅当删失类型设为区间或计数时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr "区间终点"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr "选择表示观测区间结束时间的变量。仅当删失类型设为区间或计数时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "生存时间"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr "选择表示事件发生或删失前时间的变量。仅当删失类型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "事件状态"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr "选择表示事件状态的变量，指明每个观测是事件还是删失。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "事件指示值"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr "指定事件状态变量中表示事件发生的值。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "协变量"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the parametric "
"survival model."
msgstr "添加连续变量作为协变量，将其纳入参数生存模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the parametric "
"survival model."
msgstr "添加分类变量作为因子，将其纳入参数生存模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "权重"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr "选择个案权重变量，在模型中对每个观测按相应权重加权。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "子组"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "删失类型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select right-censored data, counting-process data with delayed entry, or "
"interval-censored data."
msgstr "选择右删失数据、带有延迟进入的计数过程数据，或区间删失数据。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右侧"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "计数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "间隔"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"If interval censoring is selected, the following coding needs to be used: "
"left-censored data is represented as (NA, t2), right-censored data as (t1, "
"NA), exact data as (t, t), and interval-censored data as (t1, t2)."
msgstr ""
"如果选择区间删失，需使用以下编码：左删失数据表示为 (NA, t2)，右删失数据表示"
"为 (t1, NA)，精确数据表示为 (t, t)，区间删失数据表示为 (t1, t2)。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "删失汇总"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr "创建汇总表，包含数据删失状态的信息。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parametric distribution for the analysis. All fits and display "
"results for all 'Selected parametric families' in the 'Advanced' section. "
"'Best AIC' and 'Best BIC' fit all `Selected parametric families` in the "
"Advanced section and display the results only for a parametric family with "
"the lowest AIC/BIC."
msgstr ""
"选择分析的参数分布。所有拟合和显示结果针对“高级”部分中的所有“所选参数族”。“最"
"佳 AIC”和“最佳 BIC”会拟合“高级”部分中的所有“所选参数族”，并仅显示 AIC/BIC 最"
"低的参数族结果。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "指数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "伽马系数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized F"
msgstr "广义 F"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized gamma"
msgstr "广义 Gamma"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gompertz"
msgstr "Gompertz"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-logistic"
msgstr "对数 Logistic"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-normal"
msgstr "对数正态"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weibull"
msgstr "威布尔"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized gamma (original)"
msgstr "广义 Gamma（原始）"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized F (original)"
msgstr "广义 F（原始）"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best AIC"
msgstr "最佳 AIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best BIC"
msgstr "最佳 BIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interpret model"
msgstr "解释模型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the model to interpret. Defaults to the last specified model. "
"Alternatives are 'All' which produces results for all of the specified "
"models or 'Best' which produces results for the best fitting model based on "
"either AIC or BIC. If distribution and model selection is specified "
"simultanously, the best model within the best performing distribution is "
"going to be selected. If model selection is specified while all "
"distributions are selected, the best model within each distribution is going "
"to be selected."
msgstr ""
"选择要解释的模型。默认为最后指定的模型。其他选项包括“全部”（为所有指定模型生"
"成结果）或“最佳”（根据 AIC 或 BIC 为最佳拟合模型生成结果）。如果同时指定分布"
"和模型选择，将选择表现最佳分布中的最佳模型。如果指定模型选择且选择了所有分"
"布，则将在每个分布内选择最佳模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级选项"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Selected Parametric Distributions"
msgstr "所选参数分布"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Output Formatting"
msgstr "输出格式"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include full dataset in subgroup analysis"
msgstr "在子组分析中包含完整数据集"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset output in the subgroup analysis. This option is "
"only available when the subgroup analysis is selected."
msgstr "在子组分析中包含完整数据集的输出。仅当选择子组分析时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare models across distributions"
msgstr "跨分布比较模型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Compare models across distributions. This option is only available when the "
"multiple models and parametric distributions are specified."
msgstr "跨分布比较模型。仅当指定多个模型和参数分布时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Always display model information"
msgstr "始终显示模型信息"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Always display model information (distribution and model name) in output "
"tables."
msgstr "在输出表格中始终显示模型信息（分布和模型名称）。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the probabilities at which survival times are predicted: Quantiles, "
"Sequence, or Custom."
msgstr "选择预测生存时间所依据的概率：分位数、序列或自定义。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of predicted survival-time quantiles when using Quantiles "
"as the steps type."
msgstr "使用分位数步长类型时，指定预测生存时间分位数的数量。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the time points for prediction tables: Equal spacing, Sequence, or "
"Custom. Equal spacing uses evenly spaced times up to the maximum observed "
"time. Time plots place points adaptively within the selected range."
msgstr ""
"选择预测表的时间点：等距、序列或自定义。等距使用直到最大观测时间的等间隔时"
"间。时间图会在所选范围内自适应放置点。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the time increment when using Sequence steps. Leaving this blank uses "
"one tenth of the selected time range."
msgstr "使用序列步长时设置时间增量。留空则使用所选时间范围的十分之一。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify custom steps of the life time."
msgstr "指定寿命的自定义步长。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Predictions"
msgstr "预测"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Survival Time"
msgstr "生存时间"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Table"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted survival estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含预测生存估计的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "绘图"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted survival estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含预测生存估计的图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps type"
msgstr "步长类型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Quantiles"
msgstr "分位数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "序列"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Number"
msgstr "编号"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "From"
msgstr "起始"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the starting quantile of the predicted survival when using Sequence "
"steps."
msgstr "使用序列步长时，设置预测生存的起始分位数。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define the size of each quantile of the predicted survival when using "
"Sequence steps."
msgstr "使用序列步长时，定义预测生存每个分位数的大小。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "To"
msgstr "结束"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the ending quantile of the predicted survival when using Sequence steps."
msgstr "使用序列步长时，设置预测生存的结束分位数。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步长"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify custom steps of the predicted survival."
msgstr "指定预测生存的自定义步长。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival probability across distributions into a single "
"plot. Only available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr "将不同分布下的生存概率图合并为一张图。仅当未执行模型选择时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "置信区间"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the figures and tables."
msgstr "为图和表纳入置信区间。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the confidence level for the confidence intervals."
msgstr "设置置信区间的置信水平。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Legend"
msgstr "图例"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the position of the legend on prediction plots with multiple "
"displayed curves."
msgstr "选择多曲线预测图中图例的位置。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左侧"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Customize the color palette used in prediction plots with multiple displayed "
"curves."
msgstr "自定义多曲线预测图中使用的调色板。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the theme for prediction plots. The detailed theme works only for "
"'Survival probabilities' plots."
msgstr "选择预测图的主题。详细主题仅适用于“生存概率”图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "White background"
msgstr "白色背景"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Light"
msgstr "亮色"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "Minimal"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "详细"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Survival Probability"
msgstr "生存概率"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted survival probabilities."
msgstr "纳入包含预测生存概率的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted survival probabilities."
msgstr "纳入包含预测生存概率的图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Kaplan-Meier"
msgstr "Kaplan-Meier"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a Kaplan-Meier curve in the plot. Only available when Censoring Type is "
"set to Right."
msgstr "在图中显示 Kaplan-Meier 曲线。仅当删失类型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring events"
msgstr "删失事件"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show censoring events as rug marks in the plot. Only available when "
"Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr "在图中以地毯标记显示删失事件。仅当删失类型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "X-axis transformation"
msgstr "X 轴变换"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the transformation for the x-axis of the plot"
msgstr "选择图的 X 轴变换"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log"
msgstr "对数函数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Y-axis transformation"
msgstr "Y 轴变换"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the transformation for the y-axis of the plot"
msgstr "选择图的 Y 轴变换"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log(-log(1-p))"
msgstr "Log(-log(1-p))"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "As failure probability"
msgstr "作为失败概率"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Transform the output from survival probability to failure probability (i.e., "
"1 - Survival Probability)."
msgstr "将输出从生存概率转换为失败概率（即 1 - 生存概率）。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard"
msgstr "风险率"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted hazard estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含预测风险率估计的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted hazard estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含预测风险率估计的图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cumulative Hazard"
msgstr "累积风险"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted cumulative hazard estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含预测累积风险估计的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted cumulative hazard estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含预测累积风险估计的图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Restricted Mean Survival Time"
msgstr "限制平均生存时间"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the restricted mean survival time estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含限制平均生存时间估计的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the restricted mean survival time estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含限制平均生存时间估计的图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Equal spacing"
msgstr "等距"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of time points when using Equal spacing as the steps type."
msgstr "使用等距步长类型时，指定时间点数量。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the starting time when using Sequence steps."
msgstr "使用序列步长时设置起始时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the ending time when using Sequence steps. Leaving this blank uses the "
"maximum observed time."
msgstr "使用序列步长时设置结束时间。留空则使用最大观测时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Round steps"
msgstr "舍入步长"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Round table time points to the nearest integer when using Equal spacing or "
"Sequence steps. Time plots use unrounded points placed adaptively within the "
"selected range."
msgstr ""
"使用等距或序列步长时，将表格时间点舍入到最接近的整数。时间图在所选范围内自适"
"应放置未舍入的点。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Merge tables across measures"
msgstr "跨指标合并表格"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the tables for survival time, survival probabilities, hazard, "
"cumulative hazard, and restricted mean survival time into a single table."
msgstr ""
"将生存时间、生存概率、风险率、累积风险和限制平均生存时间的表格合并为一张表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival time, survival probabilities, hazard, "
"cumulative hazard, and restricted mean survival across distributions into a "
"single plot. Only available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""
"将不同分布下的生存时间、生存概率、风险率、累积风险和限制平均生存图合并为一张"
"图。仅当未执行模型选择时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Probability plot"
msgstr "概率图"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a model-based probability plot to assess how well the selected "
"parametric distribution describes the observed failure times. Only available "
"when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr ""
"创建基于模型的概率图，以评估所选参数分布对观测失败时间的描述程度。仅当删失类"
"型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Canvas"
msgstr "画布"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the probability-paper scale. A distribution matching the selected "
"canvas appears approximately as a straight line. The exponential canvas uses "
"linear time and cumulative-hazard probability scaling; the other canvases "
"use log time."
msgstr ""
"选择概率纸刻度。与所选画布匹配的分布近似呈直线。指数画布使用线性时间和累积风"
"险概率标度；其他画布使用对数时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Empirical points"
msgstr "经验点"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot empirical failure probability points based on the observed failure "
"times."
msgstr "绘制基于观测失败时间的经验失败概率点。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the time and failure probability next to each empirical point."
msgstr "在每个经验点旁显示时间和失败概率。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fitted curve"
msgstr "拟合曲线"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot the fitted curve from the selected parametric model."
msgstr "绘制所选参数模型的拟合曲线。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show censored observations as rug marks at the bottom of the plot. Only "
"available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr "在图的底部以地毯标记显示删失观测。仅当删失类型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the probability plots across distributions into a single plot. Only "
"available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr "将不同分布下的概率图合并为一张图。仅当未执行模型选择时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence interval bounds for the fitted probability curve."
msgstr "为拟合概率曲线纳入置信区间边界。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the confidence level for the probability plot confidence intervals."
msgstr "设置概率图置信区间的置信水平。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "网格"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display probability-paper grid lines."
msgstr "显示概率纸网格线。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plotting position"
msgstr "绘图位置"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the method used to compute empirical failure probability plotting "
"positions."
msgstr "选择计算经验失败概率绘图位置的方法。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Median"
msgstr "中位数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Benard"
msgstr "Benard"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazen"
msgstr "Hazen"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "均值"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Blom"
msgstr "Blom"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank adjustment"
msgstr "秩次调整"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the rank adjustment method for right-censored observations. The "
"Kaplan-Meier adjustment follows the WeibullR/Minitab convention, including "
"the final-failure adjustment used to keep points finite on probability paper."
msgstr ""
"选择右删失观测的秩次调整方法。Kaplan-Meier 调整遵循 WeibullR/Minitab 惯例，包"
"括用于使概率纸上的点保持有限的最终失败调整。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Johnson"
msgstr "Johnson"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Ties"
msgstr "并列值"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select how tied failure times are handled when computing empirical plotting "
"positions."
msgstr "选择计算经验绘图位置时如何处理并列的失败时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Highest"
msgstr "最高"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Lowest"
msgstr "最低"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sequential"
msgstr "顺序"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the legend position for probability plots with multiple fitted curves "
"or factor levels."
msgstr "选择具有多条拟合曲线或因子水平的概率图的图例位置。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Customize the color palette used in probability plots with multiple fitted "
"curves or factor levels."
msgstr "自定义具有多条拟合曲线或因子水平的概率图调色板。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the theme for the probability plot's appearance."
msgstr "选择概率图外观的主题。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted survival"
msgstr "残差与预测生存"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "残差图"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. time"
msgstr "残差与时间"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus time. Only available when Censoring Type is set to "
"Right."
msgstr "绘制残差与时间的关系图。仅当删失类型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predictors"
msgstr "残差与预测变量"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predictors to assess model fit. Available when model "
"terms are specified."
msgstr "绘制残差与预测变量的关系图，以评估模型拟合。指定模型项时可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot residuals versus predicted mean survival times."
msgstr "绘制残差与预测平均生存时间的关系图。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals histogram"
msgstr "残差直方图"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display a histogram of residuals to assess their distribution."
msgstr "显示残差的直方图，以评估其分布。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the type of residuals to plot"
msgstr "选择要绘制的残差类型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Response"
msgstr "响应"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cox-Snell"
msgstr "Cox-Snell"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with information about the model fit."
msgstr "纳入包含模型拟合信息的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "统计量"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model summary"
msgstr "模型摘要"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank models"
msgstr "模型排序"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank models based on the selected criterion."
msgstr "根据所选准则对模型排序。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC"
msgstr "AIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "BIC"
msgstr "BIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log lik."
msgstr "对数似然"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC weights"
msgstr "AIC 权重"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include AIC weights in the model summary."
msgstr "在模型摘要中纳入 AIC 权重。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "BIC weights"
msgstr "BIC 权重"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include BIC weights in the model summary."
msgstr "在模型摘要中纳入 BIC 权重。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "系数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with coefficient estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含系数估计的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the coefficients."
msgstr "为系数纳入置信区间。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients covariance matrix"
msgstr "系数协方差矩阵"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the covariance matrix of the coefficient estimates."
msgstr "纳入包含系数估计协方差矩阵的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sequential model comparison"
msgstr "序贯模型比较"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the results of the sequential model comparison."
msgstr "纳入包含序贯模型比较结果的表格。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export model-derived values for each observation to the dataset. Exports "
"follow the displayed model selection. When multiple models are displayed, "
"column names include distribution, model, subgroup, and (for mixtures) "
"component-count identifiers. Observations excluded from a model receive "
"missing values."
msgstr ""
"将每个观测的模型导出值写入数据集。导出遵循当前显示的模型选择。显示多个模型"
"时，列名包含分布、模型、子组以及（对于混合模型）成分数标识符。被模型排除的观"
"测将获得缺失值。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Column prefix"
msgstr "列前缀"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Optional custom prefix prepended to every exported column name, before any "
"automatic model identifier."
msgstr "可选的自定义前缀，添加在每个导出列名之前，位于任何自动模型标识符之前。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals"
msgstr "残差"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Martingale"
msgstr "Martingale"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the event indicator minus the fitted cumulative hazard for each "
"observation."
msgstr "导出每个观测的事件指示值减去拟合累积风险。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Deviance"
msgstr "偏差"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export deviance residuals from the fitted Cox model for each observation."
msgstr "导出每个观测基于拟合 Cox 模型的偏差残差。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Response"
msgstr "响应"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export observed time minus fitted mean survival time. Censored times are "
"treated as observed times. Unavailable for interval-censored data."
msgstr ""
"导出观测时间减去拟合平均生存时间。删失时间按观测时间处理。区间删失数据不可"
"用。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cox-Snell"
msgstr "Cox-Snell"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the fitted cumulative hazard at each observation's time. For counting-"
"process data, it is conditional on survival to the entry time. Unavailable "
"for interval-censored data."
msgstr ""
"导出每个观测时间点的拟合累积风险。对于计数过程数据，它以生存至进入时间为条"
"件。区间删失数据不可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fitted Values"
msgstr "拟合值"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Relative risk"
msgstr "相对风险"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the fitted relative risk, centered at the mean covariate values "
"within each stratum."
msgstr "导出拟合相对风险，以每个层内的平均协变量值为中心。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Linear predictor"
msgstr "线性预测值"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the fitted log relative risk, centered at the mean covariate values "
"within each stratum."
msgstr "导出拟合对数相对风险，以每个层内的平均协变量值为中心。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean survival time"
msgstr "平均生存时间"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the fitted mean survival time at each observation's covariate values."
msgstr "导出每个观测协变量值下的拟合平均生存时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Median survival time"
msgstr "中位生存时间"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the fitted median survival time at each observation's covariate "
"values."
msgstr "导出每个观测协变量值下的拟合中位生存时间。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mixture Classification"
msgstr "混合分类"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Component probabilities"
msgstr "成分概率"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export one posterior membership probability per mixture component, "
"conditional on the observed survival or censoring information."
msgstr "为每个混合成分导出一个后验归属概率，以观测到的生存或删失信息为条件。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Component index"
msgstr "成分索引"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Export the index of the component with the highest posterior membership "
"probability. Ties are assigned to the first component."
msgstr "导出后验归属概率最高的成分索引。并列时分配给第一个成分。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "绘图"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"This option generates a customizable survival plot to visualize the "
"estimated survival probabilities over time from your survival analysis. You "
"can choose different transformations of the survival probabilities to "
"display, such as Survival, Risk, Cumulative Hazard, or Complementary Log-Log "
"functions, depending on your analytical needs. The plot allows you to "
"include confidence intervals to assess the precision of the estimates and "
"add a risk table to provide detailed information about the number of "
"subjects at risk and events over time. You can further enhance the plot by "
"adding quantile lines to highlight specific survival times (e.g., median "
"survival time) and adjust the legend position, color palette, and overall "
"theme to suit your preferences."
msgstr ""
"此选项生成可自定义的生存图，以可视化生存分析中估计的随时间变化的生存概率。您"
"可以选择不同的生存概率变换来显示，如生存、风险、累积风险或互补双对数函数，具"
"体取决于分析需要。该图可包含置信区间以评估估计的精确度，并添加风险表以提供关"
"于随时间变化的风险人数和事件的详细信息。您还可以添加分位数线以突出特定生存时"
"间（例如中位生存时间），并调整图例位置、调色板和整体主题。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of statistic to plot: Survival, Risk, Cumulative Hazard, or "
"Complementary Log-Log."
msgstr "选择要绘制的统计量类型：生存、风险、累积风险或互补双对数。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Survival"
msgstr "生存分析"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Risk"
msgstr "风险"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Cumulative hazard"
msgstr "累积风险"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Complementary log-log"
msgstr "互补双对数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "置信区间"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include confidence intervals in the survival plot to show the variability "
"around the estimates."
msgstr "在生存图中纳入置信区间，以显示估计值周围的变异性。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Risk table"
msgstr "风险表"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Add a risk table below the plot to display additional information about the "
"number of subjects at risk over time."
msgstr "在图下方添加风险表，以显示随时间变化的风险人数的附加信息。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Number at risk"
msgstr "风险人数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the number of subjects at risk at each time point in the risk table."
msgstr "在风险表中显示每个时间点的风险人数。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Cum. number of observed events"
msgstr "累计观测事件数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the cumulative number of observed events (e.g., deaths) at each time "
"point in the risk table."
msgstr "在风险表中显示每个时间点的累计观测事件数（例如死亡数）。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Cum. number of censored obs."
msgstr "累计删失观测数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the cumulative number of censored observations at each time point in "
"the risk table."
msgstr "在风险表中显示每个时间点的累计删失观测数。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Number of events in time interval"
msgstr "时间区间内的事件数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the number of events that occurred within each time interval in the "
"risk table."
msgstr "在风险表中显示每个时间区间内发生的事件数。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Number of censored obs. in time interval"
msgstr "时间区间内的删失观测数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the number of censored observations within each time interval in the "
"risk table."
msgstr "在风险表中显示每个时间区间内的删失观测数。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "As a single line"
msgstr "合并为单行"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Combine all selected risk table statistics into a single line for a more "
"compact display."
msgstr "将所有选定的风险表统计量合并为一行，以更紧凑地显示。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Add quantile"
msgstr "添加分位数"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Add a vertical line on the plot at a specified quantile (e.g., median "
"survival time)."
msgstr "在图中指定分位数（例如中位生存时间）处添加垂直线。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Specify the quantile value (between 0 and 1) at which to add the vertical "
"line on the plot."
msgstr "指定在图中添加垂直线的分位数值（0 到 1 之间）。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Legend"
msgstr "图例"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Choose the position of the legend on the plot: Bottom, Right, Left, Top, or "
"None. Only available when Strata variables are specified."
msgstr ""
"选择图中图例的位置：底部、右侧、左侧、顶部或无。仅当指定分层变量时可用。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右侧"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左侧"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Customize the color palette used in the plot. Only available when Strata "
"variables are specified."
msgstr "自定义图中使用的调色板。仅当指定分层变量时可用。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the theme for the plot's appearance: JASP for the default look or "
"ggsurvfit for the ggsurvfit package style."
msgstr "选择图外观的主题：JASP 为默认外观，ggsurvfit 为 ggsurvfit 包样式。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "JASP"
msgstr "JASP 主题"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "ggsurvfit"
msgstr "ggsurvfit"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis performs a Cox proportional hazards regression, a statistical "
"method used in survival analysis to examine the relationship between the "
"time until an event occurs (such as death or failure) and one or more "
"predictor variables. It helps you understand how different factors influence "
"the risk or hazard of the event happening at any given time. The Cox model "
"is particularly useful because it can handle censored data (when the event "
"has not occurred for some subjects during the study period) and does not "
"require assumptions about the baseline hazard function."
msgstr ""
"本分析执行 Cox 比例风险回归，这是一种用于生存分析的统计方法，用于考察事件发生"
"前的时间（如死亡或失败）与一个或多个预测变量之间的关系。它帮助您理解不同因素"
"如何影响事件在任何给定时间发生的风险或风险率。Cox 模型尤其适用于处理删失数据"
"（研究期间某些受试者尚未发生事件），并且不要求对基线风险函数作出假设。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr "区间起点"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr "选择表示观测区间起始时间的变量。仅当删失类型设为计数时可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr "区间终点"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr "选择表示观测区间结束时间的变量。仅当删失类型设为计数时可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "生存时间"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr "选择表示事件发生或删失前时间的变量。仅当删失类型设为右删失时可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "事件状态"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr "选择表示事件状态的变量，指明每个观测是事件还是删失。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "事件指示值"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr "指定事件状态变量中表示事件发生的值。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "协变量"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the Cox regression "
"model."
msgstr "添加连续变量作为协变量，将其纳入 Cox 回归模型。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the Cox regression "
"model."
msgstr "添加分类变量作为因子，将其纳入 Cox 回归模型。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "权重"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr "选择个案权重变量，在模型中对每个观测按相应权重加权。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "删失类型"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of censoring in your data: Right censoring or Counting "
"process."
msgstr "选择数据中的删失类型：右删失或计数过程。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右侧"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "计数"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "删失汇总"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr "创建汇总表，包含数据删失状态的信息。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Efron"
msgstr "Efron"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Breslow"
msgstr "Breslow"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Exact"
msgstr "精确"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the method for handling tied event times: Efron, Breslow, or Exact."
msgstr "选择处理并列事件时间的方法：Efron、Breslow 或 Exact。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata, Cluster, and Frailty"
msgstr "分层、聚类与脆弱性"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata"
msgstr "分层"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to define strata, allowing separate baseline hazard "
"functions for each stratum."
msgstr "选择用于定义分层的变量，以便为每个层设置单独的基线风险函数。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "聚类"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable to define clusters of correlated observations for robust "
"variance estimation. Disabled when a Frailty variable is specified or Method "
"is set to Exact."
msgstr ""
"选择用于定义相关观测聚类的变量，以进行稳健方差估计。指定脆弱性变量或将方法设"
"为 Exact 时禁用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Frailty"
msgstr "脆弱性"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for frailty to model unobserved heterogeneity using random "
"effects. Disabled when a Cluster variable is specified."
msgstr "选择脆弱性变量，以使用随机效应建模未观测异质性。指定聚类变量时禁用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the distribution for the frailty term: Gamma, Gaussian, or T "
"distribution. Only available when a Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr "选择脆弱性项的分布：Gamma、Gaussian 或 T。仅当指定脆弱性变量时可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "伽马系数"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "高斯"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "T"
msgstr "T"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the estimation method for the frailty distribution. Options vary "
"based on the chosen Distribution."
msgstr "选择脆弱性分布的估计方法。选项因所选分布而异。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "EM"
msgstr "EM"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC"
msgstr "AIC"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "固定"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "REML"
msgstr "REML"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Df"
msgstr "Df"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the degrees of freedom (Df) for the T frailty distribution. Only visible "
"when Distribution is set to T."
msgstr "设置 T 脆弱性分布的自由度（Df）。仅当分布设为 T 时可见。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "固定"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parameter to fix in the frailty model when Method is set to "
"Fixed: Theta or Df."
msgstr "当方法设为 Fixed 时，选择在脆弱性模型中固定的参数：Theta 或 Df。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Theta"
msgstr "Theta"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value of Theta to fix in the frailty model. Only visible when "
"Fix is set to Theta."
msgstr "指定在脆弱性模型中固定的 Theta 值。仅当 Fix 设为 Theta 时可见。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the degrees of freedom (Df) to fix in the frailty model. Only "
"visible when Fix is set to Df."
msgstr "指定在脆弱性模型中固定的自由度（Df）。仅当 Fix 设为 Df 时可见。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Components"
msgstr "成分"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "统计量"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model fit"
msgstr "模型拟合"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include overall model fit statistics in the output."
msgstr "在输出中纳入整体模型拟合统计量。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "检验"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Test all parameters of the H₁ model."
msgstr "检验 H₁ 模型的所有参数。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Likelihood ratio"
msgstr "似然比"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include the Likelihood Ratio Test in the model summary."
msgstr "在模型摘要中纳入似然比检验。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Wald"
msgstr "Wald"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Wald Test in the model summary. Disabled when a Frailty variable "
"is specified."
msgstr "在模型摘要中纳入 Wald 检验。指定脆弱性变量时禁用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Score (log-rank)"
msgstr "Score（Log-Rank）"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Score (Log-Rank) Test in the model summary. Disabled when a "
"Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr "在模型摘要中纳入 Score（Log-Rank）检验。指定脆弱性变量时禁用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "系数"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "估计"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the estimated coefficients in the model output."
msgstr "在模型输出中显示估计系数。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Vovk-Sellke maximum p-ratio"
msgstr "Vovk-Sellke 最大 p 比值"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include the Vovk-Sellke maximum p-ratio for each coefficient."
msgstr "为每个系数纳入 Vovk-Sellke 最大 p 比值。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard ratio estimates"
msgstr "风险比估计"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the hazard ratio estimates (exponentiated coefficients)."
msgstr "显示风险比估计（指数化系数）。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include frailty"
msgstr "纳入脆弱性"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the effect of frailty in hazard ratio estimates. Only available when "
"a Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr "在风险比估计中纳入脆弱性效应。仅当指定脆弱性变量时可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "置信区间"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the coefficients."
msgstr "为系数纳入置信区间。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the confidence level (e.g., 95%) for the confidence intervals."
msgstr "设置置信区间的置信水平（例如 95%）。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "绘图"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Proportional Hazards"
msgstr "比例风险"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Table"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Provide a table to test the proportional hazards assumption."
msgstr "提供用于检验比例风险假设的表格。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generate plots to assess the proportional hazards assumption."
msgstr "生成用于评估比例风险假设的图。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Transformation"
msgstr "变换"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the transformation for time in proportional hazards testing: KM, "
"Rank, or Identity."
msgstr "选择比例风险检验中时间的变换：KM、Rank 或 Identity。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "KM"
msgstr "KM"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank"
msgstr "Rank函数"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "身份(Identity)"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Test terms"
msgstr "检验项"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Test the proportional hazards assumption for individual model terms (instead "
"of coefficients)."
msgstr "检验各个模型项（而非系数）的比例风险假设。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "残差图"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. time"
msgstr "残差与时间"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus time to detect non-proportional hazards. Available "
"only for Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr ""
"绘制残差与时间的关系图，以检测非比例风险。仅适用于 Martingale 或 Deviance 残"
"差。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predictors"
msgstr "残差与预测变量"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predictors to assess model fit. Available when model "
"terms are specified."
msgstr "绘制残差与预测变量的关系图，以评估模型拟合。指定模型项时可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted survival"
msgstr "残差与预测生存"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predicted survival probabilities. Available only for "
"Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr "绘制残差与预测生存概率的关系图。仅适用于 Martingale 或 Deviance 残差。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals histogram"
msgstr "残差直方图"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display a histogram of residuals to assess their distribution. Available "
"only for Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr "显示残差的直方图，以评估其分布。仅适用于 Martingale 或 Deviance 残差。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of residuals to plot: Martingale, Deviance, Score, "
"Schoenfeld, or Scaled Schoenfeld."
msgstr ""
"选择要绘制的残差类型：Martingale、Deviance、Score、Schoenfeld 或 Scaled "
"Schoenfeld。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Martingale"
msgstr "Martingale"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Deviance"
msgstr "偏差"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Score"
msgstr "Score"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Schoenfeld"
msgstr "Schoenfeld"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Scaled Schoenfeld"
msgstr "Scaled Schoenfeld"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis models survival times as a finite mixture of components from "
"the same parametric family."
msgstr "本分析将生存时间建模为来自同一参数族的有限混合成分。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a table with the diagnostics of the estimation of each mixture "
"model: the number of starting values, how many of them reached the reported "
"solution, the log-likelihood of the reported and of the next best distinct "
"solution, the number of degenerate candidate solutions, the effective sample "
"size and the effective number of events of the smallest component, optimizer "
"convergence, and whether the Hessian of the likelihood is positive definite. "
"Replications indicate agreement between starts, not proof of a global "
"maximum."
msgstr ""
"纳入表格，列出每个混合模型估计的诊断信息：起始值数量、其中多少个达到报告的"
"解、报告解与次优不同解的对数似然、退化候选解的数量、最小成分的有效样本量和有"
"效事件数、优化器收敛情况，以及似然 Hessian 是否正定。重复结果表示各起始值之间"
"一致，而不是全局最大值的证明。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include a plot with the fitted mixture and its components. Densities are "
"averaged over the observed predictor values, separately for each factor "
"combination unless plots are merged. Other plot types use the combined "
"prediction convention: observed levels for models with categorical "
"predictors only, or the pooled unweighted mean model design for models with "
"numeric predictors."
msgstr ""
"纳入包含拟合混合模型及其成分的图。密度按观测预测变量值平均，除非合并图，否则"
"按每个因子组合分别计算。其他图类型使用组合预测约定：仅含分类预测变量的模型使"
"用观测水平，含数值预测变量的模型使用合并的未加权均值模型设计。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "X-axis transformation"
msgstr "X 轴变换"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the transformation for the x-axis of the component plot. With Log "
"selected, density curves and histogram bins are computed for log time."
msgstr "选择成分图 X 轴的变换。选择 Log 时，密度曲线和直方图箱按对数时间计算。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log"
msgstr "对数函数"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Merge plots across factors"
msgstr "跨因子合并图"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"For density plots, average the mixture and its weighted component densities "
"over the observed predictor values, using the proportions of observations in "
"each factor combination and any case weights. When unchecked, show a "
"separate plot for each observed factor combination, averaging over its "
"observed covariate values."
msgstr ""
"对于密度图，按各因子组合中观测的比例及个案权重，对观测预测变量值上的混合密度"
"及各成分加权密度取平均。未勾选时，为每个观测到的因子组合分别显示一张图，并在"
"其观测协变量值上取平均。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Overlay a histogram of the observed time distribution on the fitted "
"densities, using the same observations as the curves: each factor "
"combination separately, or the pooled sample when plots are merged. For "
"right-censored data, bin probabilities are estimated with Kaplan-Meier and "
"any unobserved tail probability is retained."
msgstr ""
"将观测时间分布的直方图叠加到拟合密度上，使用与曲线相同的观测：每个因子组合分"
"别计算，或在合并图时使用合并样本。对于右删失数据，箱概率用 Kaplan-Meier 估"
"计，并保留任何未观测到的尾部概率。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Bin width type"
msgstr "长条形宽度类型"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the rule for histogram bin widths. With Log selected, the rule is "
"applied to log time. Select Manual to specify the number of bins."
msgstr ""
"选择直方图箱宽的规则。选择 Log 时，该规则应用于对数时间。选择 Manual 可指定箱"
"数。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sturges"
msgstr "Sturges"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Scott"
msgstr "Scott"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Doane"
msgstr "Doane"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Freedman-Diaconis"
msgstr "Freedman-Diaconis"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of bins"
msgstr "箱数"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the target number of histogram bins. Bin boundaries are rounded to "
"convenient values, as in Descriptive Statistics."
msgstr "指定直方图的目标箱数。箱边界舍入为方便的值，与描述统计中一致。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select starting values for constrained mixture estimation. The best "
"converged solution found within the minimum spread bound is reported. More "
"starts reduce the risk of a local optimum but take longer."
msgstr ""
"选择约束混合估计的起始值。报告在最小离散度界限内找到的最佳收敛解。更多起始值"
"可降低局部最优的风险，但耗时更长。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select starting values for mixture estimation. The best non-degenerate "
"solution found is reported. If all solutions are degenerate, the best is "
"reported with a warning. More starts reduce the risk of a local optimum but "
"take longer."
msgstr ""
"选择混合估计的起始值。报告找到的最佳非退化解。如果所有解都退化，则报告最佳解"
"并给出警告。更多起始值可降低局部最优的风险，但耗时更长。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Equal-sized groups"
msgstr "等大小分组"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from one partition of the ordered survival times into groups of equal "
"size."
msgstr "从将有序生存时间划分为若干等大小组的一个划分开始。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tail partitions"
msgstr "尾部划分"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from partitions that isolate the tails: 15/85% and 85/15% for two "
"components, 15/70/15% for three, and 10/40/40/10% for four."
msgstr ""
"从隔离尾部的划分开始：两个成分为 15/85% 和 85/15%，三个成分为 15/70/15%，四个"
"成分为 10/40/40/10%。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Split simpler model"
msgstr "拆分较简单模型"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Start from a model with one component fewer. Each start splits one of its "
"components at its median, keeping the other components unchanged. The "
"simpler model is fitted when needed."
msgstr ""
"从少一个成分的模型开始。每个起始值在其中位数处拆分其中一个成分，其他成分保持"
"不变。需要时拟合较简单模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Draw independent sets of random centres from the observed event times and "
"assign each observation to the nearest centre. Higher values try more sets "
"of centres."
msgstr ""
"从观测事件时间中抽取独立随机中心集，并将每个观测分配到最近的中心。值越大，尝"
"试的中心集越多。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Initialization Settings"
msgstr "初始化设置"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Apply these settings to every starting value method."
msgstr "将这些设置应用于每种起始值方法。"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Membership probability"
msgstr "归属概率"

msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Higher probabilities produce sharper starts. Each starting value is tried "
"with every initial membership probability."
msgstr "概率越高，起始值越尖锐。每个起始值都会用每个初始归属概率进行尝试。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Merge Plots Across"
msgstr "合并图范围"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr "分布"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When checked, combine observed combinations of fitted factors in one plot. "
"When unchecked, show a separate plot for each combination. In both cases, "
"predictions use the unweighted mean model design (including interaction "
"terms) within each combination."
msgstr ""
"勾选后，将拟合因子的观测组合合并到一张图中。未勾选时，为每个组合分别显示一张"
"图。两种情况下，预测均使用每个组合内的未加权均值模型设计（包括交互项）。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroups"
msgstr "子组"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Overlay the separately fitted subgroup curves in one plot, retaining "
"separate observed data for each subgroup."
msgstr "将分别拟合的子组曲线叠加到一张图中，同时保留每个子组各自的观测数据。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Confidence interval simulation draws"
msgstr "置信区间模拟抽样数"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the number of parameter draws used to simulate confidence intervals for "
"prediction tables and all model-based plot bands. More draws improve "
"precision at a higher computational cost."
msgstr ""
"设置用于模拟预测表和所有基于模型的图带置信区间的参数抽样数。抽样数越多，精度"
"越高，但计算成本也越高。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select one or more factors for subgroup analysis. Separate models are fitted "
"for each observed combination of their levels."
msgstr "选择一个或多个因子进行子组分析。为每个观测到的水平组合分别拟合模型。"

msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"Parametric survival models now always include an intercept. Results may "
"change if this saved analysis previously excluded the intercept."
msgstr ""
"参数生存模型现在始终包含截距。如果此前保存的分析排除了截距，结果可能会改变。"
